<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>2026 남해·여수·전주 가족 힐링 여행 가이드북</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css');

  @page {
    size: A4 portrait;
    margin: 14mm 15mm;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact !important;
    print-color-adjust: exact !important;
  }

  body {
    font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, system-ui, Roboto, sans-serif;
    color: #2D3748;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }

  .page {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 265mm;
    page-break-after: always;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
  }

  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }

  /* Header & Footer */
  .page-header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2B6CB0;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .page-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15pt;
    color: #1A365D;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .page-header .tag {
    font-size: 9pt;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2B6CB0;
    background: #EBF8FF;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .page-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-top: 6px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #718096;
  }

  /* Cover Styling (Page 1) */
  .cover-title-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A365D 0%, #2B6CB0 100%);
    color: white;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .cover-title-box h1 {
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    font-size: 20pt;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  }

  .cover-title-box p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  /* Tables */
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }

  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #CBD5E0;
    padding: 6px 8px;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  th {
    background-color: #EDF2F7;
    color: #2D3748;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Cards & Sections */
  .section-title {
    font-size: 11pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2C5282;
    margin: 10px 0 6px 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .timeline-list {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    padding-left: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 9pt;
  }

  .timeline-list li {
    padding: 3px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #E2E8F0;
    display: flex;
  }

  .timeline-list li .time {
    width: 105px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2B6CB0;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .spot-box {
    background: #F7FAFC;
    border-left: 4px solid #3182CE;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 8.8pt;
  }

  .spot-box h4 {
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    color: #1A365D;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
  }

  /* Dining Cards */
  .dining-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .dining-card {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
  }

  .dining-card.highlight {
    border-color: #BEE3F8;
    background: #F0F9FF;
  }

  .dining-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .badge-lunch { background: #FEFCBF; color: #744210; }
  .badge-dinner { background: #E9D8FD; color: #44337A; }
  .badge-opt1 { background: #C6F6D5; color: #22543D; }

  .tip-box {
    background: #FFF5F5;
    border: 1px solid #FEB2B2;
    color: #9B2C2C;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- PAGE 1: 전체 스케줄 총괄표 -->
<div class="page">
  <div>
    <div class="cover-title-box">
      <h1>남해 · 여수 · 전주 가족 힐링 여행북</h1>
      <p>기간: 2026. 09. 20 (일) ~ 09. 26 (토) | 6박 7일 | 동행: 부부 & 초등 5학년 딸</p>
      <p style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-top: 4px; opacity: 0.85;">동선: 의왕 오전동 ➔ 남해 쏠비치(3박) ➔ 여수 라테라스(2박) ➔ 전주 베스트웨스턴(1박) ➔ 의왕 복귀</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">📌 전체 일정 한눈에 보기 (At a Glance)</div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 14%;">일자</th>
          <th style="width: 13%;">도시/숙소</th>
          <th style="width: 45%;">핵심 일정 & 테마</th>
          <th style="width: 28%;">식사 플랜 (중식 / 석식)</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td align="center"><b>1일차</b><br>(9/20 일)</td>
          <td align="center"><b>남해</b><br>쏠비치</td>
          <td>• 04:00 의왕 출발 ➔ 08:00 번호표 발권<br>• 설리스카이워크 ➔ 12:00 방배정 ➔ 독일마을 ➔ 15:00 입실 쉼</td>
          <td><b>중:</b> 독일마을(슈바인학센/수제버거)<br><b>석:</b> 쏠비치 레스토랑 바래(뚝배기)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center"><b>2일차</b><br>(9/21 월)</td>
          <td align="center"><b>남해</b><br>쏠비치</td>
          <td>• 금산 보리암 숲길 산책 & 금산산장<br>• <b>[골든타임] 13:40 온수 인피니티풀 ➔ 17:00 야외 스케이트</b></td>
          <td><b>중:</b> 금산산장 컵라면·파전/칼국수<br><b>석:</b> 쏠비치 BBQ 다이닝/통갈치구이</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center"><b>3일차</b><br>(9/22 화)</td>
          <td align="center"><b>남해</b><br>쏠비치</td>
          <td>• <b>딸아이 생일 Day 🎂</b><br>• 남면 드라이브 ➔ 다랭이마을 '카페 톨' 오션뷰 생일파티 ➔ 만찬</td>
          <td><b>중:</b> 헐스밴드 화덕피자/한우구이<br><b>석:</b> 쏠비치 메인 디너 코스 만찬</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center"><b>4일차</b><br>(9/23 수)</td>
          <td align="center"><b>여수</b><br>라테라스</td>
          <td>• 11:00 쏠비치 퇴실 ➔ 이순신대교 바다 드라이브<br>• 돌산 오션뷰 카페 ➔ <b>라테라스 15:40 입실 & 온전한 쉼</b></td>
          <td><b>중:</b> 돌산 갓갈치조림/한일관 한정식<br><b>석:</b> 라테라스 씨푸드그릴/생선구이</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td align="center"><b>5일차</b><br>(9/24 목)</td>
